# A spell's additional cost is its own paid list (SpellAbility.getPaidList,
# AbilityUtils.java:713): Fling's Cost$ sacrifices the Hill Giant as it is
# cast, and `X:Sacrificed$CardPower` reads that creature's power from its
# last-known information when Fling resolves -- 3 damage to the opponent.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets ai
queue sacrificechoice 4
castspell human 1
resolvestack
